&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company, freeing people and agents to ship what&#39;s next. For more than a decade we&#39;ve helped builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now we&#39;re scaling our products for both agents and people to ship and run software, built in the open and trusted by OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, Commercial, you’ll win net-new logos by selling Vercel’s frontend cloud to developers and engineering leaders at digital-native companies at the leading edge of modern web and AI, tying it to outcomes such as speed, conversion, productivity, and reliability. You’ll run full-cycle deals alongside Solutions Architects, Marketing, Product, and Customer Success, helping teams adopt Vercel and expand as they scale, and help shape how Vercel goes to market as the Commercial segment grows. Success means consistent new logo acquisition and hitting your revenue and pipeline targets. We prefer to grow talent internally, with a path to larger scopes and leadership over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For candidates in Berlin, this is a hybrid role with 3 in-office days per week in our Berlin hub.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a net-new revenue number by building and progressing pipeline from first meeting through close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through outbound prospecting, multi-threading, and account research, and partner with your BDR on top-of-funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run full-cycle deals with Solutions Architects and Customer Success: discovery, qualification, deal strategy, technical evaluation, stakeholder alignment, negotiation, and close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute territory and account plans that drive consistent new logo acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a weekly forecast, keep Salesforce stages, next steps, and close plans accurate, and track leading indicators such as meetings and pipeline creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you need&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of full-cycle B2B sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of generating your own pipeline through outbound prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closed net-new customers, from discovery through negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sold to technical buyers such as developers and engineering leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus if you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have sold into teams at Mid-Enterprise level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have sales experience at a product-led growth (PLG) company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on frontend development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Learn and Grow - we provide mentorship and send you to events that help you build your network and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Time Off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We will provide you the gear you need to do your role, and a WFH budget for you to outfit your space as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;te-floating-button-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
